      "This is a vintage black-and-white postcard depicting a building labeled as the 'Sanatorium Dr. Enters, Gartenhaus' in Pyrmont. The building is two stories high with ornate windows, a tiled roof, and a garden path leading to a veranda surrounded by trees and plants. The reverse side contains handwritten text in German and a printed label 'Museum im Schloss Bad Pyrmont.'"
